  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n P\n D\n S\n V\n \n \n\n Stands For\n +\n -\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\nGiven: {10 D (15 D 23)} V {5 S 2 D (4)} P 28 V (14 D 7)\n\n{10 D (15 D 23)} V {5 S 2 D (4)} P 28 V (14 D 7) ⇒ {10 - (15 - 23)} ÷ {5 × 2 - (4)} + 28 ÷ (14 - 7)\n\n⇒ {10 - __**(15 - 23)**__} ÷ {5 × 2 - **(**__**4)**__} + 28 ÷ __**(**____**14 - 7)**__\n\n⇒ __**{10 + 8}**__ ÷ {__**5 ×**____** 2**__ - 4} + __**28 **____**÷ 7**__\n\n⇒ 18 ÷ __**{10**____** - 4}**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**18 **____**÷ 6**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**3**____** + 4**__\n\n⇒ 7\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
